OL,3,GNEWSAChemicals at former fuel depot
OL,4,A'have been removed'
OL,5,
OL,6,FBarrels of chemicals left at an
OL,7,Fapproved development site have been
OL,8,Fremoved and testing carried out, a
OL,9,Fdeveloper has said.
OL,11,FThe Islip Fuel Depot in Oxfordshire is
OL,12,Fa former RAF and Esso fuel storage and
OL,13,Ftransfer facility and has had outline
OL,14,Fplanning permission approved to build
OL,15,Fresidential and affordable homes.
OL,17,FConcerns were raised after campaigners
OL,18,Fdiscovered about 40 barrels of
OL,19,Ffirefighting foam liquid, which
OL,20,Fcontains PFAS - a group of chemicals
OL,21,Foften dubbed forever chemicals, had
OL,22,Fbeen left at the site for decades.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
