OL,3,GNEWSAChemicals at former fuel depot
OL,4,A'have been removed'
OL,5,
OL,6,FDeveloper, Newcore, said it had already
OL,7,Fidentified the potential contamination
OL,8,Fand that "this potential risk and any
OL,9,Fcontamination identified will be
OL,10,Fcleaned up immediately."
